    https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct

  * SmolLM2-135M-Instruct
    Copyright Hugging Face. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    https://huggingface.co/HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM2-135M-Instruct

Evaluation data (not redistributed; downloaded on demand, used only for quality
measurement and never shipped in any artifact):

  * WikiText-2 (Merity, Xiong, Bradbury, Socher, 2016)
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0).
